msgid "The recipe best range does not fully fit this building's usable range; the limit applies to control-mode production. The default mode still works across the building range at low/high efficiency, and forced run may go past the building limit."
msgstr "配方最佳温区与本建筑可用范围不完整匹配；限制针对普通控制生产。默认模式仍可在建筑工作范围内按低温／高温效率生产，强制运行可越过建筑上限。"

