msgstr "加热功率"

msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.UISIDESCREENS.MATERIALOVERHAUL.HEATING_POWER.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Heating power: {0} W. Preheating, top-up heating and forced sustained heating share this setting (20–4000 W). While producing, heating power is added to production power. The setting is saved per building."
msgstr "当前加热功率：{0} W。预热、补热与强制持续加热共用此设置（20–4000 W）。生产时加热用电额外计入，总用电为生产用电与加热用电之和。设置随本建筑保存。"
